      "reason": "Outcomes are listed and defined, but other data items sought (e.g., participant and intervention characteristics, funding sources) are not explicitly listed and defined in the methods; some variables appear only implicitly in a trial characteristics table (table_5) without definitions."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10b_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "We used the trial results reported at maximum follow-up for all outcomes. We used intention-to-treat data if provided by the trialists [8]. ... To assess the potential impact of missing data, we performed sensitivity analyses using 'best-worst' and 'worst-best' analysis [8, 15].",
      "reason": "Some assumptions about handling data (maximum follow-up, ITT when provided, sensitivity analyses for missing data) are described, but explicit assumptions about missing or unclear information for the extracted variables are not fully described."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10b_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No tool or guidance used to determine which data items to collect is cited in the retrieved evidence; data collection is only referenced to the published protocol."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 80
