      "quote": null,
      "reason": "Non-standard graphs such as the rank heat plot (Fig 3) and Trial Sequential Analysis monitoring-boundary plots are used, but no rationale for these non-standard displays is reported in the retrieved evidence."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 82
}

